## Wearable data (auto-updated by briefings)

The briefings keep these three sections current. You don't hand-edit them. They feed the morning chip, weekly section, and monthly memo (see [`docs/health-system.md`](../docs/health-system.md)). Each metric below is **active** — pulled and tracked from the reconciled wearable stream.

### Latest daily (written by the morning brief)

| Metric | Latest | Baseline / target | Flag? |
|--------|--------|-------------------|-------|
| Sleep duration / score | {{value}} | {{target}} | {{deviation flag}} |
| Resting HR | {{value}} | {{baseline}} | {{>baseline+5?}} |
| HRV | {{value}} | {{7-day avg}} | {{sharp drop?}} |
| Zone-2 minutes | {{value}} | {{target}} | {{multi-day zero?}} |
| Weight | {{value}} | {{smoothed}} | {{spike?}} |
| Valid-data days this week | {{n/7}} | ≥ ~80% | {{suppress if low}} |

### Weekly trends (written by the weekly review)

